{"text": " PERFORM VARYING i FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i <= 100)\n       DIVIDE i BY 3 GIVING rem1 REMAINDER rem1\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
{"text": "1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i <= 100)\n       DIVIDE i BY 3 GIVING rem1 REMAINDER rem1\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
{"text": " (i <= 100)\n       DIVIDE i BY 3 GIVING rem1 REMAINDER rem1\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
{"text": "       DIVIDE i BY 3 GIVING rem1 REMAINDER rem1\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
{"text": "IVING rem1 REMAINDER rem1\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
{"text": "\n       DIVIDE i BY 7 GIVING rem2 REMAINDER rem2\n       IF rem1=0 AND rem2=0\n       DISPLAY \"First number divisible by both 3 and 7 is: \"   i\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
