{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. CodingNinjas_Java_DSA_MultiplicationTable.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  scan_main       PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 10)\n       MULTIPLY i_main BY n_main GIVING TEMP_"}
{"text": "-ID. CodingNinjas_Java_DSA_MultiplicationTable.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  scan_main       PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 10)\n       MULTIPLY i_main BY n_main GIVING TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n"}
{"text": "_DSA_MultiplicationTable.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  scan_main       PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 10)\n       MULTIPLY i_main BY n_main GIVING TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  scan_main       PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP<|fim_suffix|>       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 10)\n       MULTIPLY i_main BY n_main GIVING TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  scan_main       PIC X(100).\n       01<|fim_suffix|> MAIN-PARA.\n      * Write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 10)\n       MULTIPLY i_main BY n_main GIVING TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MULTIPLICATIONTABLE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n      "}
