{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. CodingNinjas_Java_DSA_Premium_Continue.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CONTINUE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CONTINUE_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * TODO Auto-generated method stub\n       MOVE 5 TO n_main\n       MOVE 1 TO i_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n      * if you put i++ after continue it will result in infinite loop after 2 3 4 because continue will skip the current iteation and i++ will never occur.\n       ADD 1 TO i_main\n       IF i_main = 4\n       END-IF\n       DISPLAY i_main\n       END-PERFORM"}
{"text": "-ID. CodingNinjas_Java_DSA_Premium_Continue.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CONTINUE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CONTINUE_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * TODO Auto-generated method stub\n       MOVE 5 TO n_main\n       MOVE 1 TO i_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n      * if you put i++ after continue it will result in infinite loop after 2 3 4 because continue will skip the current iteation and i++ will never occur.\n       ADD 1 TO i_main\n       IF i_main = 4\n       END-IF\n       DISPLAY i_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
