{"text": " j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Read input as specified in the question.\n    \t\t * Print output as specified in the question.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT N_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= N_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < i_main)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= TEMP_0)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM N_main BY -1 UNTIL"}
{"text": ").\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Read input as specified in the question.\n    \t\t * Print output as specified in the question.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT N_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= N_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < i_main)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= TEMP_0)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM N_main BY -1 UNTIL NOT (j_main >= 1)\n"}
{"text": " PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Read input as specified in the question.\n    \t\t * Print output as specified in the question.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT N_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= N_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < i_main)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= TEMP_0)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM N_main BY -1 UNTIL NOT (j_main >= 1)\n       SUBTRACT i_main FROM N_main"}
{"text": "EDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Read input as specified in the question.\n    \t\t * Print output as specified in the question.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT N_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= N_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < i_main)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= TEMP_0)\n       DISPLAY \"0\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = (N_main - i_main)\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY \"*\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM N_main BY -1 UNTIL NOT (j_main >= 1)\n       SUBTRACT i_main FROM N_main GIVING j_main\n       DISPLAY \""}
