{"text": "1 TO i_main\n       MOVE 3 TO j_main\n       MOVE 2 TO m_main\n       MOVE replaceBits(n_main, i_main, j_main, m_main) TO n_main\n       DISPLAY n_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "3 TO j_main\n       MOVE 2 TO m_main\n       MOVE replaceBits(n_main, i_main, j_main, m_main) TO n_main\n       DISPLAY n_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
