{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_main PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA<|fim_suffix|>       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      *<|fim_middle|>.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Create new Scanner object\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset"}
{"text": " PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Create new Scanner object\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Create new Scanner object\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 100<|fim_suffix|> BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 G<|fim_middle|>0 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE"}
{"text": "\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Create new Scanner object\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER current"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ARA.\n      * Create new Scanner object\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 197<|fim_suffix|> the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main<|fim_middle|>0\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n"}
{"text": "\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> enabled\n      * Prompt user to enter the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute<|fim_suffix|>_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY<|fim_middle|> in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 G"}
{"text": " the time offset of GMT\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY current"}
{"text": " \"Enter the time zone offset to GMT: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours<|fim_suffix|>       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":<|fim_middle|>\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the"}
{"text": "       ACCEPT offset_main\n      * Obtain the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentSecond_main\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> the total milliseconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 197<|fim_suffix|>INDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentSecond_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>0\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMA"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>1, 1970\n      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current<|fim_suffix|>       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentSecond_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n"}
{"text": "      * Obtain the total seconds since midnight, Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentSecond_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": ", Jan 1, 1970\n       DIVIDE totalMilliseconds_main BY 1000 GIVING totalSeconds_main\n      * Compute the current second in the minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING currentSecond_main REMAINDER currentSecond_main\n      * Obtain the total minutes\n       DIVIDE totalSeconds_main BY 60 GIVING totalMinutes_main\n      * Compute the current minute in the hour\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING currentMinute_main REMAINDER currentMinute_main\n      * Obtain the total hours\n       DIVIDE totalMinutes_main BY 60 GIVING totalHours_main\n      * Compute the current hour\n       DIVIDE totalHours_main BY 24 GIVING currentHour_main REMAINDER currentHour_main\n       ADD currentHour_main TO offset_main GIVING currentHour_main\n      * Display results\n       DISPLAY \"Current time is \"\n       DISPLAY currentHour_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentMinute_main\n       DISPLAY \":\"\n       DISPLAY currentSecond_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
