{"text": "9).\n       01 TEMP_17 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main *"}
{"text": "17 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANC<|fim_suffix|>_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n<|fim_middle|>ING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e<|fim_suffix|> d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP<|fim_middle|>, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 ="}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n      <|fim_middle|>_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n"}
{"text": "-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>DT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0<|fim_suffix|>_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 / TEMP_9\n      <|fim_middle|> = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> user to enter a, b, c, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n<|fim_suffix|>E TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 / TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE x_main = TEMP_1<|fim_middle|>       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>, d, e, and f.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 / TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE x_main = TEMP_10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1<|fim_middle|> b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP"}
{"text": "       DISPLAY \"Enter a, b, c, d, e, f: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT a_main\n       ACCEPT b_main\n       ACCEPT c_main\n       ACCEPT d_main\n       ACCEPT e_main\n       ACCEPT f_main\n      * Solve the linear equation\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_1 - TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = TEMP_3\n       IF TEMP_0 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"The equation has no solution.\"\n       ELSE\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = e_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = b_main * f_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_4 - TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = a_main * d_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = b_main * c_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_7 - TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 / TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE x_main = TEMP_10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_11 = a_main * f_main\n"}
