{"text": "-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a year, month, and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE"}
{"text": "ARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a year, month, and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 G"}
{"text": "-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a year, month, and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP"}
{"text": "DT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter a year, month, and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_"}
{"text": " user to enter a year, month, and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_"}
{"text": " and day of the month.\n       DISPLAY \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY"}
{"text": " \"Enter year: (e.g., 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> 2012): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2<|fim_suffix|>_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n<|fim_middle|> = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth"}
{"text": " NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT year_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP"}
{"text": "_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter month: 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_8 / 4\n       COMPUT"}
{"text": " 1-12: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_8 / 4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_"}
{"text": " NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT month_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_8 / 4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 + TEMP_9\n       COMPUT"}
{"text": "_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the day of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_8 / 4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 + TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_11 = year_main"}
{"text": " of the month: 1-31: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT dayOfMonth_main\n      * Convert January and February to months 13 and 14 of the previous year\n       IF month_main = 1  OR  month_main = 2\n       COMPUTE month_main = 14\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM year_main\n       END-IF\n      * Calculate day of the week\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = month_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 26 * TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 / 10\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = dayOfMonth_main + TEMP_2\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_3 + TEMP_5\n       DIVIDE year_main BY 100 GIVING TEMP_7 REMAINDER TEMP_8\n       COMPUTE TEMP_9 = TEMP_8 / 4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_10 = TEMP_6 + TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_11 = year_main / 100\n       COMPUT"}
