{"text": "       COMPUTE TEMP_14 = year_main / 100\n       COMPUTE TEMP_15 = 5 * TEMP_14\n       COMPUTE TEMP_16 = TEMP_13 + TEMP_15\n       DIVIDE TEMP_16 BY 7 GIVING TEMP_17 REMAINDER TEMP_18\n       COMPUTE dayOfWeek_main = TEMP_18\n      * Display reslut\n       DISPLAY \"Day of the week is \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EVALUATE dayOfWeek_main\n       WHEN 0\n       DISPLAY \"Saturday\"\n       WHEN 1\n       DISPLAY \"Sunday\"\n       WHEN 2\n       DISPLAY \"Monday\"\n       WHEN 3\n       DISPLAY \"Tuesday\"\n       WHEN 4\n       DISPLAY \"Wednesday\"\n       WHEN 5\n       DISPLAY \"Thursday\"\n       WHEN 6\n       DISPLAY \"Friday\"\n       END-EVALUATE\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
