{"text": "9).\n       01 TEMP_9 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7"}
{"text": "9 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from<|fim_suffix|>8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n<|fim_middle|> ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main G"}
{"text": "ARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "ARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " is enabled\n      * prompt the user to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " to enter the length from\n      * the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " the center of a pentagon to a vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " vertex\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the length from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> from the center to a vertex: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_<|fim_suffix|> = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI /<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING"}
{"text": " r_main\n      * Compute the area of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> of the pentagon\n      * Length of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main ="}
{"text": " of a side\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = 2 * r_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = Math * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE s_main = TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = s_main * 2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_4 = PI / 5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = Math * TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TAN / TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE area_main = TEMP_6\n      * Display results\n       DIVIDE n BY area_main GIVING TEMP_8 REMAINDER TEMP_9\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = TEMP_9\n       DISPLAY TEMP_7 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
