{"text": "FORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Count the number of positive numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO positives_main\n      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number_main > 0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END-IF\n      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD"}
{"text": ".\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Count the number of positive numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO positives_main\n      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number_main > 0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END-IF\n      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD 1 TO count_main\n       ACCEPT"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Count the number of positive numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO positives_main\n      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL<|fim_suffix|>0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END-IF\n      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD 1 TO count_main\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       END-PERFORM<|fim_middle|> NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number"}
{"text": " * Count the number of positive numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO positives_main\n      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number_main > 0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END-IF\n      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD 1 TO count_main\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Calculate the average\n      "}
{"text": "       MOVE 0 TO positives_main\n      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number_main > 0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END-IF\n      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD 1 TO count_main\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Calculate the average\n       DIVIDE total_main BY count_main G"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>      * Count the number of negative numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO negatives_main\n      * Count all numbers\n       MOVE 0 TO count_main\n      * Accumulate a totol\n       MOVE 0 TO total_main\n      * Promopt the user to enter an integer or 0 to exit\n       DISPLAY \"Enter an integer, the input ends if it is 0: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       IF number_main = 0\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       DISPLAY \"No numbers are entered except 0\"\n       STOP RUN\n       END-IF\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (number_main NOT = 0)\n      * Test for sentinel value\n       IF number_main > 0\n      * Increase positives\n       ADD 1 TO positives_main\n      * Increase negatives\n<|fim_suffix|>      * Accumulate total\n       ADD total_main TO number_main GIVING total_main\n      * Increase the count\n       ADD 1 TO count_main\n       ACCEPT number_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Calculate the average\n       DIVIDE total_main BY count_main GIVING average_main\n      * Display results<|fim_middle|>       ELSE\n       ADD 1 TO negatives_main\n       END"}
