{"text": "ANCING\n       ACCEPT score_main\n       IF i_main = 0\n      * Make the first student the highest scoring student so far\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main"}
{"text": "       IF i_main = 0\n      * Make the first student the highest scoring student so far\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the"}
{"text": "      * Make the first student the highest scoring student so far\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> scoring student so far\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n      <|fim_suffix|>2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score<|fim_middle|> MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name"}
{"text": "_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n      "}
{"text": "_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF"}
{"text": "\n       IF i_main = 1  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>  AND  score_main > highest_main\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO second<|fim_suffix|>_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n<|fim_middle|>Higest_main\n       MOVE student1_main"}
{"text": "\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      *"}
{"text": "      * higher than first student\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name<|fim_suffix|>Higest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with<|fim_middle|>_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score"}
{"text": "\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with the second-hightest score.\n      "}
{"text": "\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with the second-hightest score.\n       DISPLAY \"Higest scoring student: \"\n"}
{"text": "2_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with the second-hightest score.\n       DISPLAY \"Higest scoring student: \"\n       DISPLAY student1_main\n       DISPLAY"}
{"text": " student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with the second-hightest score.\n       DISPLAY \"Higest scoring student: \"\n       DISPLAY student1_main\n       DISPLAY \"\\nSecond Higest scoring student:"}
{"text": " IF i_main = 1\n      * Second student entered scored\n      * lower than first student\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > highest_main  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the highest score\n       MOVE highest_main TO secondHigest_main\n       MOVE student1_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO highest_main\n       MOVE name_main TO student1_main\n       ELSE\n       IF i_main > 1  AND  score_main > secondHigest_main\n      * Last student entered has the second highest score\n       MOVE name_main TO student2_main\n       MOVE score_main TO secondHigest_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display the student with the hightest score\n      * and the student with the second-hightest score.\n       DISPLAY \"Higest scoring student: \"\n       DISPLAY student1_main\n       DISPLAY \"\\nSecond Higest scoring student: \"\n       DISPLAY student2_main\n      "}
