{"text": "ISE_05_13_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_EXERCISE_05_13_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Intialize n at 0;\n       MOVE 0 TO n_main\n      * Find the largest n such that n^3 is < 12,000\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 < 12000)\n      * Increment n\n       ADD 1 TO n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Largest integer n such that n^3 is less than 12,0"}
{"text": "\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_EXERCISE_05_13_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Intialize n at 0;\n       MOVE 0 TO n_main\n      * Find the largest n such that n^3 is < 12,000\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 < 12000)\n      * Increment n\n       ADD 1 TO n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Largest integer n such that n^3 is less than 12,000: \"\n       DISPLAY n_main"}
{"text": "_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_EXERCISE_05_13_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Intialize n at 0;\n       MOVE 0 TO n_main\n      * Find the largest n such that n^3 is < 12,000\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 < 12000)\n      * Increment n\n       ADD 1 TO n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = Math.pow(n_main + 1, 3)\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Largest integer n such that n^3 is less than 12,000: \"\n       DISPLAY n_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
