{"text": " (e.g., 100): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT amount_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the annual interest rate (e.g., 5): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compound"}
{"text": "): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT amount_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the annual interest rate (e.g., 5): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REM"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       ACCEPT amount_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the annual interest rate (e.g., 5): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n     <|fim_suffix|> m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUT<|fim_middle|> * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM"}
{"text": "Enter the annual interest rate (e.g., 5): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_5"}
{"text": "., 5): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_5\n       DISPLAY TEMP_3 WITH NO"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ANCING\n       ACCEPT annualInterestRate_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n     <|fim_suffix|>5\n       DISPLAY TEMP_3 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      * Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 ="}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of months (e.g., 6): \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT months_main\n      * Compute monthly interest rate\n       DIVIDE annualInterestRate_main BY 1200 GIVING monthlyInterestRate_main\n      * Compute amount in the savings account after the given month\n      *<|fim_suffix|> BY 1 UNTIL NOT (m_main <= months_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = amount_main + compoundValue_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = 1 + monthlyInterestRate_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE compoundValue_main = TEMP_2\n       END-PERFORM\n      * Display result\n       DISPLAY \"Amount in savings account after \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY months_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DIVIDE n BY compoundValue_main GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_5\n       DISPLAY TEMP_3 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> Accumulates compount value\n       MOVE 0 TO compoundValue_main\n       PERFORM VARYING m_main FROM 1"}
