{"text": ".\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter the first 9 digits of a 10-digit ISBN\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the first 9 digits of an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-P"}
{"text": " enabled\n      * Prompt the user to enter the first 9 digits of a 10-digit ISBN\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the first 9 digits of an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF d10"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> enter the first 9 digits of a 10-digit ISBN\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the first 9 digits of an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n<|fim_suffix|>IDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF d10_main = 10\n       DISPLAY<|fim_middle|>       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> 10-digit ISBN\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the first 9 digits of an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF d10_main = 10\n       DISPLAY \"X\"\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY<|fim_middle|>_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> \"Enter the first 9 digits of an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 *<|fim_suffix|>IDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF d10_main = 10\n       DISPLAY \"X\"\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY d10_main\n       END-<|fim_middle|> TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM"}
{"text": " an ISBN as integer: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT isbn_main\n       MOVE 0 TO d10_main\n      * Extract the digits of the ISBN and compute d10\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = charAt + i_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_0 * TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = isbn_main + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE d10_main = TEMP_3\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE d10_main BY 11 GIVING d10_main REMAINDER d10_main\n      * Display the 10-digit ISBN\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 9)\n       DISPLAY isbn_main.charAt(i_main) WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF d10_main = 10\n       DISPLAY \"X\"\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY d10_main\n       END-IF\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
