{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CALC_GLOBAL\n       01  in_main         PIC X(100).\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  ch_main         PIC X(1).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_2 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN<|fim_suffix|>\n       ACCEPT ch_main\n       EVALUATE ch_main\n       WHEN '+'\n       DISPLAY a_main\n       DISPLAY b_main\n       WHEN '-'\n       SUBTRACT b_main FROM a_main GIVING TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       WHEN '*'\n       MULTIPLY a_main BY b_main GIVING TEMP_1\n       DISPLAY TEMP_1\n<|fim_middle|>.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT a_main\n      "}
