{"text": "_BLOCK_WHILE_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_CALCULATOR_GLOBAL\n       01  num1_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  num2_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>ULATOR_GLOBAL\n       01  num1_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  num2_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers<|fim_suffix|> ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main<|fim_middle|>\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2"}
{"text": " num1_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  num2_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>5).\n       01  num2_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA<|fim_suffix|>_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '*'\n       MULTIPLY<|fim_middle|>.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*' "}
{"text": "2_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '*'\n       MULTIPLY num1_main BY num2_main G"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter<|fim_suffix|>       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT num1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '*'\n       MULTIPLY num1_main BY num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF<|fim_middle|> the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Take input from user till user does not press X or x\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (true)\n      * take the operator as input\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the operator: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       MOVE FUNCTION CHAR(in_main.next().trim().charAt(0)) TO op_main\n       IF<|fim_suffix|>1_main\n       ACCEPT num2_main\n       IF op_main = '+'\n       ADD num1_main TO num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '-'\n       SUBTRACT num2_main FROM num1_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '*'\n       MULTIPLY num1_main BY num2_main GIVING ans_main\n       END-IF\n       IF op_main = '/'\n      <|fim_middle|> op_main = '+'  OR  op_main = '-'  OR  op_main = '*'  OR  op_main = '/'  OR  op_main = '%'\n      * input two numbers\n       DISPLAY \"Enter two numbers: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n"}
