{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_Q2_GLOBAL\n       01  in_main         PIC X(100).\n       01  kwh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main      <|fim_suffix|> days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n<|fim_middle|> PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0"}
{"text": " for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_Q2_GLOBAL\n       01  in_main         PIC X(100).\n       01  kwh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0  AND  days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n       DISPLAY \"The bill is: \"\n"}
{"text": "2_GLOBAL\n       01  in_main         PIC X(100).\n       01  kwh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0  AND  days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n       DISPLAY \"The bill is: \"\n       DISPLAY bill_main\n       ELSE\n"}
{"text": " in_main         PIC X(100).\n       01  kwh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0  AND  days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n       DISPLAY \"The bill is: \"\n       DISPLAY bill_main\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"Invalid input\"\n       END"}
{"text": "0).\n       01  kwh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0  AND  days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n       DISPLAY \"The bill is: \"\n       DISPLAY bill_main\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"Invalid input\"\n       END-IF\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "wh_main        PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  cost_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  bill_main       PIC S9(5)V9(2).\n       01  days_main       PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * electricity bill program\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the amount of kwh used: \"\n       ACCEPT kwh_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the cost of the kwh: \"\n       ACCEPT cost_main\n       DISPLAY \"Enter the number of days used: \"\n       ACCEPT days_main\n       MOVE 0 TO bill_main\n       IF kwh_main > 0  AND  cost_main > 0  AND  days_main > 0\n       MULTIPLY kwh_main BY cost_main GIVING bill_main\n       DIVIDE bill_main BY days_main GIVING bill_main\n       DISPLAY \"The bill is: \"\n       DISPLAY bill_main\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"Invalid input\"\n       END-IF\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
