{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. MinOfThree.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MINOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MINOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  c_main          PIC S<|fim_suffix|> a_main TO min_main\n       IF b_main < min_main\n       MOVE b_main TO min_main\n       END-IF\n       IF c_main < min_main\n       MOVE c_main TO min_main\n       END-IF\n       DISPLAY min_main\n      <|fim_middle|>9(5).\n       01  min_main        PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 12 TO a_main\n       MOVE 7 TO b_main\n       MOVE 20 TO c_main"}
{"text": "-ID. MinOfThree.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MINOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MINOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  c_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  min_main        PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 12 TO a_main\n       MOVE 7 TO b_main\n       MOVE 20 TO c_main\n       MOVE a_main TO min_main\n       IF b_main < min_main\n       MOVE b_main TO min_main\n       END-IF\n       IF c_main < min_main\n       MOVE c_main TO min_main\n       END-IF\n       DISPLAY min_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
