{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. P28_RandomLoop.\n\n\n      <|fim_suffix|>_P28_RANDOMLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_P28_RANDOMLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  r_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < 5)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = RANDOM * 50\n       COMPUTE r_main = TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY r_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_P28_RANDOMLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS"}
