{"text": "_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = val_main / 1\n       COMPUTE stars_main = TEMP_0\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       MOVE val_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       DISPLAY temp_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       IF j_main <= stars_main / 2\n       ADD 1 TO temp_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM temp_main\n       END-IF"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA<|fim_suffix|>ERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       DISPLAY temp_main WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       IF j_main <= stars_main / 2\n       ADD 1 TO temp_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM temp_main\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n      <|fim_middle|>.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = val_main / 1\n       COMPUTE stars_main = TEMP_0\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       MOVE val_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n"}
