{"text": "5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM"}
{"text": "FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main"}
{"text": "       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main"}
{"text": " PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n"}
{"text": " Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL<|fim_suffix|> spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT <|fim_middle|> NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT"}
{"text": "01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main"}
{"text": "9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main\n       ADD 1 TO spaces_main"}
{"text": "ISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main\n       ADD 1 TO spaces_main\n       END-IF\n       END"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n<|fim_suffix|>1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main\n       ADD 1 TO spaces_main\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUB"}
{"text": " RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main\n       ADD 1 TO spaces_main\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= spaces_main)\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main <= stars_main)\n       IF i_main = n_main / 2 + 1  OR  j_main >= stars_main / 2 + 1\n       DISPLAY \"*\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ELSE\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF i_main <= n_main / 2\n       ADD stars_main TO 2 GIVING stars_main\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM spaces_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT 2 FROM stars_main GIVING stars_main\n       ADD 1 TO spaces_main\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
