{"text": "9(9).\n       01 TEMP_3 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n"}
{"text": " TEMP_3 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i"}
{"text": ").\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE"}
{"text": " ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = j_main\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n<|fim_suffix|>_2 = j_main\n       DISPLAY TEMP_2 WITH NO ADVANC<|fim_middle|>       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n      "}
{"text": " MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = j_main\n       DISPLAY TEMP_2 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \" \" WITH NO"}
{"text": " ODT is enabled\n      * Declaration & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = j_main\n       DISPLAY TEMP_2 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \" \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PER"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> & Initialization\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PER<|fim_suffix|>1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = j_main\n       DISPLAY TEMP_2 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \" \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n<|fim_middle|>FORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m"}
{"text": "       ACCEPT m_main\n      * INPUT\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING rows_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (rows_main <= TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       PERFORM VARYING cols_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (cols_main <= TEMP_1)\n       ACCEPT arr_main(rows_main + 1)[cols_main]\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = m_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = n_main - 1\n       END-PERFORM\n      * OUTPUT\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < m_main)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = i_main + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = j_main\n       DISPLAY TEMP_2 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \" \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
