{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       getProduct-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_getProduct\n       MOVE 1 TO power_getProduct\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n2_getProduct NOT = 0)\n       DIVIDE n2_getProduct BY 10 GIVING l2_getProduct REMAINDER l2_getProduct\n       DIVIDE n2_getProduct BY 10 GIVING n2_getProduct\n       MOVE gpwsd(b_getProduct, n1_getProduct, l2_getProduct) TO pwsd_getProduct\n      * ans = ans +  (pwsd * power);\n       MOVE getSum(b_getProduct, ans_getProduct, pwsd_getProduct * power_getProduct) TO ans_getProduct\n       MULTIPLY power_getProduct<|fim_suffix|>       MOVE 0 TO carry_gpwsd\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n1_gp<|fim_middle|> BY 10 GIVING power_getProduct\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       gpwsd-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_gpwsd\n       MOVE 1 TO power_gp"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       getProduct-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_getProduct\n       MOVE 1 TO power_getProduct\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n2_getProduct NOT = 0)\n       DIVIDE n2_getProduct BY <|fim_suffix|>IVING n2_getProduct\n       MOVE gpwsd(b_getProduct, n1_getProduct, l2_getProduct) TO pwsd_getProduct\n      * ans = ans +  (pwsd * power);\n       MOVE getSum(b_getProduct, ans_getProduct, pwsd_getProduct * power_getProduct) TO ans_getProduct\n       MULTIPLY power_getProduct BY 10 GIVING power_getProduct\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       gpwsd-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_gpwsd\n       MOVE 1 TO power_gpwsd\n       MOVE 0 TO carry_gpwsd\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n1_gpwsd NOT = 0  OR<|fim_middle|>10 GIVING l2_getProduct REMAINDER l2_getProduct\n       DIVIDE n2_getProduct BY "}
