{"text": " DIVIDE n_decimalToAnyBase BY b_decimalToAnyBase GIVING d_decimalToAnyBase REMAINDER d_decimalToAnyBase\n       DIVIDE n_decimalToAnyBase BY b_decimalToAnyBase GIVING n_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = p_decimalToAnyBase * d_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = rv_decimalToAnyBase + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE rv_decimalToAnyBase = TEMP_3\n       MULTIPLY p_decimalToAnyBase BY 10 GIVING p_decimalToAnyBase\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT b1_main\n       ACCEPT b2_main\n       MOVE getValue(n_main, b1_main, b2_main) TO d_main\n       DISPLAY d_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " b_decimalToAnyBase GIVING d_decimalToAnyBase REMAINDER d_decimalToAnyBase\n       DIVIDE n_decimalToAnyBase BY b_decimalToAnyBase GIVING n_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = p_decimalToAnyBase * d_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = rv_decimalToAnyBase + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE rv_decimalToAnyBase = TEMP_3\n       MULTIPLY p_decimalToAnyBase BY 10 GIVING p_decimalToAnyBase\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT b1_main\n       ACCEPT b2_main\n       MOVE getValue(n_main, b1_main, b2_main) TO d_main\n       DISPLAY d_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_decimalToAnyBase REMAINDER d_decimalToAnyBase\n       DIVIDE n_decimalToAnyBase BY b_decimalToAnyBase GIVING<|fim_suffix|>_3 = rv_decimalToAnyBase + TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE rv_decimalToAnyBase = TEMP_3\n       MULTIPLY p_decimalToAnyBase BY 10 GIVING p_decimalToAnyBase\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT b1_main\n       ACCEPT b2_main\n       MOVE getValue(n_main, b1_main, b2_main) TO d_main\n       DISPLAY d_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> n_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = p_decimalToAnyBase * d_decimalToAnyBase\n       COMPUTE TEMP"}
