{"text": " 01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  ld_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_2 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE n_main TO num_main\n       MOVE 0 TO nod_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (num_main NOT = 0)\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING num_main\n       ADD 1 TO nod_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= nod_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING ld_main REMAINDER ld_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = ld_main"}
{"text": " S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  ld_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_2 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE n_main TO num_main\n       MOVE 0 TO nod_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (num_main NOT = 0)\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING num_main\n       ADD 1 TO nod_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       MOVE 0 TO ans_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= nod_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING ld_main REMAINDER ld_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = ld_main - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP"}
