{"text": "_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  factors_main    PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  div_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT t_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= t_main)\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE 0 TO factors_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       PERFORM VARYING div_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       ADD factors_main TO 1 GIVING factors_main\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  factors_main    PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  div_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT t_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= t_main)\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE<|fim_suffix|> FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       ADD factors_main TO 1 GIVING factors_main\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main<|fim_middle|> 0 TO factors_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       PERFORM VARY"}
{"text": "       01  factors_main    PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  div_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT t_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= t_main)\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE 0 TO factors_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       PERFORM VARYING div_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       ADD factors_main TO 1 GIVING factors_main\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       END-PER"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  div_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT t_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= t_main)\n       ACCEPT<|fim_suffix|> * div_main\n       PERFORM VARYING div_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       ADD factors_main TO 1 GIVING factors_main\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF factors_main = <|fim_middle|> n_main\n       MOVE 0 TO factors_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0"}
{"text": " Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  div_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT t_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= t_main)\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       MOVE 0 TO factors_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       PERFORM VARYING div_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (TEMP_0 <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       ADD factors_main TO 1 GIVING factors_main\n       EXIT PERFORM\n       END-IF\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = div_main * div_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       IF factors_main = 0\n       DISPLAY \"prime\"\n      "}
