{"text": "  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  stpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM"}
{"text": "5).\n       01  stpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt"}
{"text": "pt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT"}
{"text": ").\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n"}
{"text": "_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE"}
{"text": "\n       01  enpt_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1)"}
{"text": "_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP"}
{"text": "      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_FOR_BLOCK_FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i<|fim_suffix|> NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADV<|fim_middle|>_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting<|fim_suffix|> Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM<|fim_middle|> Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main"}
{"text": "_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n      "}
{"text": "       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine<|fim_suffix|>pt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (en"}
{"text": " DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       PERFORM VARYING stpt_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (stpt_main < n_main)\n       PERFORM VARYING enpt_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (enpt_main < n_main)\n      * Starting Pt, Ending Pt\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM stpt_main BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= enpt_main)\n      * Print Subarray\n       MOVE a_main(i_main + 1) TO TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0 WITH NO ADVANCING\n       DISPLAY \"\t\" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
