{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Pepcoding-DSA_Reverse of Number.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS<|fim_suffix|>0 REMAINDER TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING n_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  scn_main        PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING TEMP_"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>-ID. Pepcoding-DSA_Reverse of Number.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      *<|fim_suffix|>_main BY 10 GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING n_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  scn_main        PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> of Number.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  scn_main        PIC X(100).\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC<|fim_suffix|>IVING n_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|> S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (n_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_0\n       DISPLAY TEMP_0\n       DIVIDE n_main BY 10 G"}
