{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       01 TEMP_3 PIC S9<|fim_suffix|>      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main<|fim_middle|>(9).\n       01 TEMP_4 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_4 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n<|fim_suffix|>\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE<|fim_middle|>      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER"}
{"text": "1 TEMP_4 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIV"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE<|fim_suffix|>temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING<|fim_middle|> 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNT"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1<|fim_suffix|>3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING rem_main REMAINDER rem_main\n<|fim_middle|>\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main G"}
{"text": " 01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING rem_main REMAINDER rem_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main"}
{"text": "9(9).\n       01 TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING rem_main REMAINDER rem_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING n_main\n       COMPUTE"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> TEMP_7 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n       MOVE 0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n     <|fim_suffix|>IDE n_main BY div_main GIVING rem_main REMAINDER rem_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = counter_main - k<|fim_middle|> * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is<|fim_suffix|>0 TO counter_main\n       MOVE n_main TO temp_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (temp_main > 0)\n       ADD 1 TO counter_main\n       DIVIDE temp_main BY 10 GIVING temp_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      * k = k % counter;\n      * if (k < 0)\n      * { k = k + counter; }\n       DIVIDE k_main BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = TEMP_1 + counter_main\n       DIVIDE TEMP_2 BY counter_main GIVING TEMP_3 REMAINDER TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE k_main = TEMP_4\n       COMPUTE div_main = k_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING rem_main REMAINDER rem_main\n       DIVIDE n_main BY div_main GIVING n_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_5 = counter_main - k_main\n       COMPUTE mult_main =<|fim_middle|> enabled\n       ACCEPT n_main\n       ACCEPT k_main\n"}
