{"text": ".\n\n\n       swap-PARA.\n       MOVE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) TO temp_swap\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = right_swap + 1\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> arr_swap(left_swap + 1) TO temp_swap\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = right_swap + 1\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP<|fim_suffix|> = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP<|fim_middle|>_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE"}
{"text": " TO temp_swap\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = right_swap + 1\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUT"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>_0 = right_swap + 1\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate<|fim_suffix|> arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8<|fim_middle|> GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE"}
{"text": "\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(left_swap + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> + 1) = TEMP_0\n       COMPUT<|fim_suffix|>       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA<|fim_middle|>E arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>\n       COMPUTE arr_swap(right_swap + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP<|fim_suffix|> a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n      <|fim_middle|>_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements"}
{"text": " + 1) = temp_swap\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       EXIT.\n\n\n       reverse-PARA.\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE<|fim_suffix|>       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate G<|fim_middle|> a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse<|fim_suffix|> - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_9\n       MOVE TEMP<|fim_middle|>\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>left_reverse < right_reverse)\n       MOVE arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0<|fim_suffix|>E TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_9\n       MOVE TEMP_9 TO left_reverse\n       SUB<|fim_middle|> TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate"}
{"text": " arr_reverse TO arr_swap\n       MOVE left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_9\n       MOVE TEMP_9 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM n_rotate GIVING"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> left_reverse TO left_swap\n       MOVE right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING<|fim_suffix|> TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_9\n       MOVE TEMP_9 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_10\n       MOVE TEMP<|fim_middle|> TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP"}
{"text": " right_reverse TO right_swap\n       PERFORM swap-PARA\n       ADD 1 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM right_reverse\n       END-PERFORM\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       rotate-PARA.\n      * write your code here\n       DIVIDE k_rotate BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_2\n       COMPUTE TEMP_3 = TEMP_2 + n_rotate\n       DIVIDE TEMP_3 BY n_rotate GIVING TEMP_4 REMAINDER TEMP_5\n       COMPUTE k_rotate = TEMP_5\n      * First n-k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       MOVE 0 TO left_reverse\n       COMPUTE TEMP_7 = n_rotate - k_rotate\n       COMPUTE TEMP_8 = TEMP_7 - 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_6 = TEMP_8\n       MOVE TEMP_6 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n      * Last k elements\n       MOVE a_rotate TO arr_reverse\n       SUBTRACT k_rotate FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_9\n       MOVE TEMP_9 TO left_reverse\n       SUBTRACT 1 FROM n_rotate GIVING TEMP_10\n       MOVE TEMP_10 TO right_reverse\n      "}
