{"text": "1\n       MOVE TEMP_11 TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE k_main = readLine\n       MOVE a_main TO a_rotate\n       MOVE k_main TO k_rotate\n       PERFORM rotate-PARA\n       MOVE a_main TO a_display\n       PERFORM display-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> TO right_reverse\n       PERFORM reverse-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (<|fim_suffix|> MOVE k_main TO k_rotate\n       PERFORM rotate-PARA\n       MOVE a_main TO a_display\n       PERFORM display-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE k_main = readLine\n       MOVE a_main TO a_rotate\n      "}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       COMPUTE n_main = readLine\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 0 BY 1 U<|fim_suffix|>       PERFORM rotate-PARA\n       MOVE a_main TO a_display\n       PERFORM display-PARA\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>NTIL NOT (i_main < n_main)\n       COMPUTE a_main(i_main + 1) = readLine\n       END-PERFORM\n       COMPUTE k_main = readLine\n       MOVE a_main TO a_rotate\n       MOVE k_main TO k_rotate\n"}
