{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  scn_main        PIC X(100).\n       01  str<|fim_suffix|> BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_toggleCase < TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_toggleCase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = i_toggleCase\n       IF TEMP_1 >= 'A'  AND<|fim_middle|>_main        PIC X(100).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_2 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_3 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_4 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       toggleCase-PARA.\n       MOVE \"\" TO ans_toggleCase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = str_toggleCase.length()\n       PERFORM VARYING i_toggleCase"}
{"text": "100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_MAIN_GLOBAL\n       01  scn_main        PIC X(100).\n       01  str_main        PIC X(100).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_2 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_3 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_4 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_5 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_6 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       toggleCase-PARA.\n       MOVE \"\" TO ans_toggleCase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = str_toggleCase.length()\n       PERFORM VARYING i_toggleCase FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_toggleCase < TEMP_0)\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = i_toggleCase\n       COMPUTE TEMP_2 = i_toggleCase\n       IF TEMP_1 >= 'A'  AND  TEMP_2 <= 'Z'\n"}
