{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program28_ProductEven.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n<|fim_suffix|>_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 10 TO n_main\n       MOVE 1 TO prod_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       DIVIDE i_main BY 2 GIVING TEMP_0 REMAINDER<|fim_middle|>       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM28_PRODUCTEVEN_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM28_PRODUCTEVEN_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  prod_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM28"}
