{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program35_FibonacciLoop.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  n1_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n2_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n3_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  count_main      PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO n1_main\n       MOVE 1 TO n2_main\n       MOVE 8 TO count_main\n       DISPLAY n"}
{"text": "-ID. Program35_FibonacciLoop.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  n1_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n2_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n3_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  count_main      PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO n1_main\n       MOVE 1 TO n2_main\n       MOVE 8 TO count_main\n       DISPLAY n1_main\n       DISPLAY n2_main"}
