{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCC<|fim_suffix|>(5).\n       01  count_main      PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO n1_main\n       MOVE 1 TO n2_main\n       MOVE 8 TO count_main\n       DISPLAY n1_main\n       DISPLAY n2_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main < count_main)\n       ADD n1_main TO<|fim_middle|>URS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM35_FIBONACCILOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  n1_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n2_main         PIC S9(5).\n       01  n3_main        "}
