{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program36_FindGCD.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM36_FINDGCD_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM36_FINDGCD_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 36 TO a_main\n       MOVE 24 TO b_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (a_main NOT = b_main)\n       IF a_main > b_main\n       SUBTRACT b_main FROM a_main GIVING a_main\n       ELSE\n       SUBTRACT a_main FROM b_main GIVING b_main\n       END-IF\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY a_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
