{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program38_PowerUsingLoop.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  base_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  exp_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  result_main     PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO base_main\n       MOVE 5 TO exp_main\n       MOVE 1 TO result_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= exp_main)\n       MULTIPLY"}
{"text": "-ID. Program38_PowerUsingLoop.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  base_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  exp_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  result_main     PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO base_main\n       MOVE 5 TO exp_main\n       MOVE 1 TO result_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= exp_main)\n       MULTIPLY result_main BY base_main GIVING result"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>Loop.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n          <|fim_suffix|>.\n       MOVE 2 TO base_main\n       MOVE 5 TO exp_main\n       MOVE 1 TO result_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= exp_main)\n       MULTIPLY result_main BY base_main GIVING result_main\n       END-PERFORM\n<|fim_middle|> 05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  base_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  exp_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  result_main     PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n      "}
{"text": " WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  base_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  exp_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  result_main     PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO base_main\n       MOVE 5 TO exp_main\n       MOVE 1 TO result_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= exp_main)\n       MULTIPLY result_main BY base_main GIVING result_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY result_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
{"text": " Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  base_main       PIC S9(5).\n       01  exp_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  result_main     PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM38_POWERUSINGLOOP_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO base_main\n       MOVE 5 TO exp_main\n       MOVE 1 TO result_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= exp_main)\n       MULTIPLY result_main BY base_main GIVING result_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY result_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
