{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program41.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM41_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM41_GLOBAL\n       01  n_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  fact_main       PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM41_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 5 TO n_main\n       MOVE 1 TO fact_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= n_main)\n       MULTIPLY fact_main BY i_main GIVING fact_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY fact_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
