{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program43_MaxOfThree.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM43_MAXOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM43_MAXOFTHREE_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  c_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  max_main        PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       IF a_main >= b_main  AND  a_main >= c_main\n       MOVE a_main TO max_main\n       ELSE\n       IF b_main >= a_main  AND  b_main >= c_main\n       MOVE b_main TO max_main\n       ELSE\n       MOVE c_main TO max_main\n       END-IF\n       END-IF\n      "}
