{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program56.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM56_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05<|fim_suffix|>  max_main        PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 5 TO x_main\n       MOVE 7 TO y_main\n       IF x_main > y_main\n       MOVE x_main TO max_main\n       ELSE\n       MOVE y_main TO max_main\n       END-IF\n       DISPLAY max_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n<|fim_middle|>  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM56_GLOBAL\n       01  x_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  y_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01"}
