{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program65.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  num_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_WHILE_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  d_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 345 TO num_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (num_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING d_main REMAINDER d_main\n       ADD sum_main TO d_main GIVING sum_main\n       DIVIDE num_main"}
{"text": "-ID. Program65.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  num_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_WHILE_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  d_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 345 TO num_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (num_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING d_main REMAINDER d_main\n       ADD sum_main TO d_main GIVING sum_main\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING num_main"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n<|fim_suffix|> d_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 345 TO num_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       PERFORM UNTIL NOT (num_main > 0)\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING d_main REMAINDER d_main\n       ADD sum_main TO d_main GIVING sum_main\n       DIVIDE num_main BY 10 GIVING num_main\n       END-PERFORM\n      <|fim_middle|>       01  num_main        PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_WHILE_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM65_SUMOFDIGITS_GLOBAL\n       "}
