{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program80.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM80_SUMALTERNATE_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM80_SUMALTERNATE_GLOBAL\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM80_SUMALTERNATE_GLOBAL\n       01  i_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       PERFORM VARYING i_main FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_main <= 20)\n       ADD sum_main TO i_main GIVING sum_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DISPLAY sum_main\n       EXIT.\n\n\n"}
