{"text": "ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END"}
{"text": "_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum"}
{"text": ") OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum_main BY 2 GIVING TEMP_"}
{"text": " TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum_main BY 2 GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n"}
{"text": "BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum_main BY 2 GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0"}
{"text": "\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum_main BY 2 GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"Even Sum: \"\n"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|>          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM95_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 6 TO a_main\n       MOVE 3 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM<|fim_suffix|> GIVING TEMP_1 REMAINDER TEMP_1\n       IF TEMP_1 = 0\n       DISPLAY \"Even Sum: \"\n       DISPLAY sum_main\n       ELSE\n<|fim_middle|> VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       END-PERFORM\n       DIVIDE sum_main"}
