{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. Program98.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO a_main\n       MOVE 6 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARY"}
{"text": "-ID. Program98.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO a_main\n       MOVE 6 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY "}
{"text": " DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO a_main\n       MOVE 6 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main"}
{"text": " SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO a_main\n       MOVE 6 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum"}
{"text": "METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  a_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  b_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum_main        PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_PROGRAM98_GLOBAL\n       01  j_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 2 TO a_main\n       MOVE 6 TO b_main\n       MOVE 0 TO sum_main\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = a_main + b_main\n       PERFORM VARYING j_main FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (j_main < TEMP_0)\n       ADD sum_main TO j_main GIVING sum_main"}
