{"text": "_minJumps PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MINJUMPS_CLASS_SOLUTION_GLOBAL\n       01  i_minJumps      PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_min"}
{"text": ").\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MINJUMPS_CLASS_SOLUTION_GLOBAL\n       01  i_minJumps      PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n"}
{"text": "_BLOCK_METHOD_MINJUMPS_CLASS_SOLUTION_GLOBAL\n       01  i_minJumps      PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable"}
{"text": "OLUTION_GLOBAL\n       01  i_minJumps      PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 ="}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> i_minJumps      PIC S9(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_min<|fim_suffix|> current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = i_minJumps + 1\n<|fim_middle|>Jumps\n      * The farthest point"}
{"text": "(5).\n       01 TEMP_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = i_minJumps + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = arr"}
{"text": "_0 PIC S9(9).\n       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = i_minJumps + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = arr_minJumps + TEMP_0\n"}
{"text": "       01 TEMP_1 PIC S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARYING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0 = i_minJumps + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = arr_minJumps + TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE farthest_minJumps"}
{"text": "<|fim_prefix|> S9(9).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       ENTRY-PARA.\n           PERFORM MAIN-PARA\n           STOP RUN.\n\n\n       minJumps-PARA.\n      * If there's only one element, no jumps are needed\n       IF n_minJumps = 1\n       END-IF\n      * If the first element is 0, it's not possible to move anywhere\n       IF arr_minJumps[0] = 0\n       END-IF\n      * Initialize variables\n      * Number of jumps made\n       MOVE 0 TO jumps_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the current number of jumps\n       MOVE 0 TO currentEnd_minJumps\n      * The farthest point reachable with the next jump\n       MOVE 0 TO farthest_minJumps\n       PERFORM VARY<|fim_suffix|>Jumps + 1\n       COMPUTE TEMP_1 = arr_minJumps + TEMP_0\n       COMPUTE farthest_minJumps = TEMP_1\n      * If<|fim_middle|>ING i_minJumps FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i_minJumps < n_minJumps)\n      * Update the farthest point reachable\n       COMPUTE TEMP_0"}
