{"text": "       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.\n       PROGRAM-ID. SumNatural.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TEST_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_-ARRAY    .\n           05  args         PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TEST_GLOBAL\n       01  sc              PIC X(100).\n       01  n               PIC S9(5).\n       01  sum1             PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:FOR_BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TEST_GLOBAL\n       01  i               PIC S9(5).\n\n\n       PROCEDURE DIVISION.\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n      * Input from ODT is enabled\n       DISPLAY \"Enter N: \" WITH NO ADVANCING\n       ACCEPT n\n       MOVE 0 TO sum1\n       PERFORM VARYING i FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL NOT (i <= n)\n       ADD sum1 TO i GIVING sum1\n       END-PERFORM.\n       DISPLAY \"Sum = \"   sum1.\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
