{"text": "-ID. Test31.\n\n\n       DATA DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_ADD_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  x_add           PIC S9(5).\n       01  y_add           PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_ADD_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  z_add           PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  x_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  u_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO x_main\n       MOVE 1 TO u_main\n       MOVE x_main TO x_add\n       MOVE u_main TO y_add\n       PERFORM ADD-PARA\n\n       add-PARA.\n       ADD x_add TO y_add GIVING z_add\n       DISPLAY \"The addition is :\"   z_add\n"}
{"text": " DIVISION.\n       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_ADD_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  x_add           PIC S9(5).\n       01  y_add           PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_ADD_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  z_add           PIC S9(5).\n      * Variables for Scope:METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  ARGS_MAIN_-ARRAY.\n           05  args_main    PIC X(100) OCCURS 100 TIMES.\n      * Variables for Scope:BLOCK_METHOD_MAIN_CLASS_TESTSCOPED_GLOBAL\n       01  x_main          PIC S9(5).\n       01  u_main          PIC S9(5).\n\n\n\n       MAIN-PARA.\n       MOVE 0 TO x_main\n       MOVE 1 TO u_main\n       MOVE x_main TO x_add\n       MOVE u_main TO y_add\n       PERFORM ADD-PARA\n\n       add-PARA.\n       ADD x_add TO y_add GIVING z_add\n       DISPLAY \"The addition is :\"   z_add\n       EXIT.\n       STOP RUN.\n\n"}
